============
Package Manager sample imports -- never commit these
============
# Package Manager extracts Samples~/<Sample> here on import. The canonical source is
# Packages/<pkg>/Samples~/, so anything committed from here is a duplicate that then has
# to be kept in sync by hand. Import freely to test; the copy stays local.
Assets/Samples/
Assets/Samples.meta

